00:25:40.717 --> 00:25:43.242
Aku bisa tetap di rumah
dan menonton pertandingan.

00:25:43.887 --> 00:25:46.219
Ya, tentu saja, Anda bisa, Pak Jensen...

00:25:46.390 --> 00:25:49.689
